    {"x":60,"y":705,"w":860,"h":95,"text":"<b>As-built multi-agent demo.</b>  \u2460 A user asks a plant-floor question in the browser over HTTPS.  \u2461 The <b>FastAPI trace UI</b> hands a <b>ScenarioSpec</b> to the <b>Magentic orchestrator</b>, which plans, dispatches, and replans (manager gpt-5.4 / workers gpt-5.4-mini).  \u2462 It dispatches from 10 <b>portal-managed Foundry prompt agents</b> across two projects.  \u2463 Each agent grounds itself through its <b>Foundry IQ</b> knowledge base via an MCP tool (policy docs + indexed rows).  \u2464 SQL sources read <b>Azure SQL</b> live via IndexedSqlKnowledgeSource with managed-identity auth and change tracking.  Non-Azure mark: FastAPI app shown with the App Service icon."}
